<title>UK: London &amp; Manchester says premiums up.</title>
<headline>London &amp; Manchester says premiums up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurance company London &amp; Manchester Group Plc said on Monday that total group new annual premiums rose by 3.6 pct in 1996 to 24.7 million stg, while its managed fund investments climbed 17.3 percent to 64.1 million stg.</p>
</text>
